      "body": "## Changelog   \n### ✨ Features   \n* c5fece4b: feat(stack): add --skip-push for local stack synchronization (Ahmed Anwar <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* e924cf16: feat: add update subcommand for managed binaries (Kai Armstrong <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n### 🐛 Bug Fixes   \n* a70f5c8c: fix(ci): scroll and reveal truncated job names (Aleksandr Sheikin <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* dc4a00ea: fix(commands): do not offer filename completions if no args taken (Ville Skyttä <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* 68b06896: fix(df): stream large binary downloads safely (Michael Eddington <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* 6c11bf31: fix(label): show the real total in the list header (unstable-code <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* 6853ff19: fix(mr): warn when publishing --reviewer-state on your own merge request (Andrei Zubov <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n### 📦 Dependencies   \n* 37ea25e1: chore(deps): bump golangci-lint to v2.14.0 (GitLab Renovate Bot <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* ba3f9187: chore(deps): update module github.com/docker/cli to v29.8.2+incompatible (GitLab Renovate Bot <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* 048eec04: chore(deps): update module github.com/tidwall/pretty to v1.2.2 (GitLab Renovate Bot <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n### 🔧 Maintenance   \n* a722b341: chore: combine the integration test coverage with the unit test coverage (Swapnaneel Patra <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n### 🔀 Others   \n* ab082413: perf(mr-note): improving note lookup using early exit searching (Parth Sharma <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* e1c33d76: test: mock the OS keyring in every test binary (Kai Armstrong <redacted@example.invalid>)\n\n",
